ney?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>The shelf life of Organic Wild Forest Honey is 12 months when stored properly in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_nFptDg":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How should Organic Wild Forest Honey be stored?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Store the honey in a cool, dry place away from heat and sunlight. It does not require refrigeration but may naturally crystallize over time. Gently warm the jar in a bowl of warm water to restore its liquid form.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_cNCYkp":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How can I enjoy Organic Wild Forest Honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>You can drizzle it over oatmeal, stir it into tea, spread it on toast, use it in salad dressings, or as a topping for pancakes, smoothies, and desserts.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_UPqk4C":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is Organic Wild Forest Honey raw or processed?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Organic Wild Forest Honey is pure and unprocessed, ensuring its natural enzymes, nutrients, and flavor remain intact, without any additives or artificial ingredients.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_KBwYVk","collapsible_row_GJNCBB","collapsible_row_GmU3iF","collapsible_row_C3NXWN","collapsible_row_9eQ6hg","collapsible_row_nFptDg","collapsible_row_cNCYkp","collapsible_row_UPqk4C"],"custom_css":[".collapsible-content-wrapper-narrow {max-width: 80%;}"],"settings":{"caption":"","heading":"Q & A Section","heading_size":"h2","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"","container_color_scheme":"","open_first_collapsible_row":true,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"custom_liquid_LtUNqz":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<!-- Start of Judge.me code -->\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div style='clear:both'><\/div><div id='judgeme_p